      "id": "L1.U14.S01",
      "text": {
        "hi": "कुछ अक्षरों की एक दूसरी आवाज़ भी होती है। चलो सुनते हैं!",
        "hinglish": "Kuch akshron ki ek doosri awaaz bhi hoti hai. Chalo sunte hain!",
        "en": "Some letters have a second sound too. Let's listen!"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_sound",
      "id": "L1.U14.S02",
      "skills": [
        "sound.th"
      ],
      "letters": "th",
      "sound": "c22_th_this",
      "hint": "द",
      "text": {
        "hi": "‘th’ की एक और आवाज़ है! जीभ दाँतों के बीच रखो और गले से बोलो, जैसे this और mother में।",
        "hinglish": "‘th’ ki ek aur awaaz hai! Jeebh daanton ke beech rakho aur gale se bolo, jaise this aur mother mein.",
        "en": "‘th’ has another sound! Put your tongue between your teeth and use your voice, as in this and mother."
      },
      "example": {
        "english": "mother",
        "emoji": "👩",
        "hindi": "माँ",
        "hinglish": "maa"
      }
    },
