      "hint": "उ",
      "text": {
        "hi": "कभी-कभी ‘oo’ छोटा बोलता है: उ, जैसे book में। moon वाला ‘ऊ’ लंबा है।",
        "hinglish": "Kabhi-kabhi ‘oo’ chhota bolta hai: u, jaise book mein. Moon waala ‘oo’ lamba hai.",
        "en": "Sometimes ‘oo’ is short, as in book. The ‘oo’ in moon is long."
      },
      "example": {
